<title>UK: UK CBI May distributive trades survey.</title>
<headline>UK CBI May distributive trades survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of results from the Confederation of British Industry's May distributive trades survey (percentage balances -- difference between number replying positively and negatively to questions):</p>
